{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04003","headline":"晦日宴高氏林亭 · 陈嘉言","name":"晦日宴高氏林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公子申敬爱，携朋翫物华。\n人是平阳客，地即石崇家。\n水文生旧浦，风色满新花。\n日暮连归骑，长川照晚霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈嘉言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04003.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04003","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}